title ALES62 — Lotus's attack/hold/release downward expander: the held quartet made whole
prompt recur the itinerary Lindy-first crux-first after ALES61; take the next agent-doable Lotus lap, send it as its own signed round, stop at custody gates
think ALES56 built the hold stage inside the follower; ALES57-59 spent it for the gate, compressor, and limiter (the held trio, mirroring the un-held trio ALES53-55). ALES60 added the expander as the fourth classic dynamics processor and ALES61 gave it attack/release. The expander was the one member with no held form — so the crux that completes a symmetric HELD QUARTET is to give the expander its hold.
think The rung mirrors ALES57 (held gate) line for line, with the gate's below-threshold DIVISION replaced by ALES60's below-threshold WIDENING. Same expand_hold_follow / expand_hold_follow_carry pair sharing one implementation, carrying both the i64 envelope and the u32 hold countdown; same ExpandEnvHoldError faults (adds BadHold); same per-sample hold_env.env_step_hold advance. The one changed step: e<thr -> target exp = max(0, thr - (thr-e)*num/den), gain exp/e applied to the raw sample.
think The crux law is the family signature: hold_samples==0 reduces env_step_hold to env_step, so this held expander reduces to ALES61's un-held expander byte-for-byte. Proven by running both tools. The hold-specific proof mirrors the gate's: a nonzero hold keeps the expander IDLE across a brief dip (loud/dip/loud, instant attack/release, hold 0 vs 1) — the pinned peak stays above threshold so the dip passes, the pump gone, the dip strictly louder held.
think Overflow and divide-by-zero guards are the gate's: (thr-e)*num fits i64, m*exp fits i64, e==0 implies x==0 (env_step forces a unit step toward any nonzero target and the hold only ever pins a peak, never lowers it) so no zero-envelope divide.
think Monotonic stamp: live clock read 20260814.184011 (TZ=America/New_York), after ALES61's 183555 — later-is-larger holds.
obs GREEN on the first build; the ALES57 idiom carried over clean with only the gain law swapped. tame_style_check bans clean, >=2 asserts per fn each with a positive // invariant:. The HELD dynamics quartet is now whole — gate, compressor, limiter, expander all reading ALES56's one env_step_hold, the exact mirror of the un-held quartet. Purely local — no lookahead, socket, network, keys, funds, device, or sample rate; every custody gate untouched.
